{'symbol': 'CZR', 'date': '2022-07-20 12:00:00', 'title': 'CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT RECEIVES TOP SCORE ON 2022 DISABILITY EQUALITY INDEX ®', 'text': "COMPANY DUBBED BEST PLACE TO WORK FOR DISABILITY INCLUSION FOR 2ND CONSECUTIVE YEAR\xa0 LAS VEGAS , JULY 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT, THE LARGEST CASINO-ENTERTAINMENT COMPANY\u202fIN THE U.S., RECEIVED A TOP SCORE ON THIS YEAR'S DISABILITY EQUALITY INDEX ® \xa0 (DEI), A JOINT INITIATIVE OF THE AMERICAN ASSOCIATION OF PEOPLE WITH DISABILITIES (AAPD) AND DISABILITYIN. UP FROM 80 ON LAST YEAR'S INDEX, THE COMPANY RECEIVED A 100, MARKING IT AS ONE OF THE BEST PLACES TO WORK FOR DISABILITY INCLUSION."}